voter: Security Reviewer
choice: A
confidence: medium
reason: A synchronous 12-month streamed CSV fits Finance's need and reuses the existing org-filtered path, while B needs an e-mail provider and a queue that don't exist, but the unauthenticated x-org-id header must be resolved with the owner before shipping.
